{
  "schema": "glab-axi/read-parity-contract/v1",
  "reference": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/kunchenguid/gh-axi",
    "commit": "2bffd9a5b60ded64d6c9851683b27a480173a7ee",
    "source": ["src/commands/issue.ts", "src/commands/pr.ts", "test/commands/issue.test.ts", "test/commands/pr.test.ts"]
  },
  "backend": "official-glab 1.112.0 (816e3a52)",
  "envelope": "glab-axi/ux-v1",
  "differences": [
    "GitLab opened is the canonical state; open is accepted as a convenience alias. Closed excludes merged MRs; merged has its own selector.",
    "Labels are repeated exact AND filters. CSV, duplicate labels and provider selector keywords are rejected. Author/assignee require explicit usernames, not @me.",
    "Issue sort supports created and updated descending, not GitHub comment count. MR branches use source-branch and target-branch.",
    "Explicit fields projects only declared OPTIONAL GitLab fields, retaining required identity/state. Reference fields is additive. Omission preserves existing defaults.",
    "Description is opt-in on lists and on by default in views; body-limit lowers its 131072-byte hard cap. There is no unbounded full mode.",
    "Milestone/closed/merged timestamp enrichment, issue comments and MR approvals are not delivered here. Existing MR discussions remain a separate shipped read.",
    "Native glab-axi/v1 and its argv/schema contract are unchanged."
  ],
  "accepted": [
    ["issue", "list"],
    ["issue", "list", "--state", "open"],
    ["issue", "list", "--state", "opened"],
    ["issue", "list", "--state", "closed", "--label", "triage", "--label", "needs review", "--author", "alice", "--assignee", "bob", "--milestone", "release 2", "--sort", "updated"],
    ["issue", "list", "--state=all", "--sort=created", "--fields=description,labels", "--body-limit=32"],
    ["issue", "view", "42", "--fields", "author,labels,created_at,updated_at"],
    ["issue", "view", "42", "--fields=description", "--body-limit=0"],
